using the 110% BG model. The company is currently focusing on asset-light operations, expanding private-sector clients, and preparing new digital ventures such as the TReDS platform, an electronic platform for EPR certificates, and a travel portal. Furthermore, the joint venture MMRPL turned profitable this quarter.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"Management aims to maintain an average double-digit growth rate over the long run.","quote":"So, our aim is to maintain a double-digit number.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management expects the positive trend in feedstock inflows and financial outlook for the joint venture MMRPL to strengthen and continue.","quote":"And we expect this trend to strengthen and continue, driving towards a healthy financial outlook for this company.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"The travel and logistics portal named MSTC Smart Travel is in final stages of testing and expected to be operationalized shortly in the B2B space.","quote":"This portal is also in its final stages of testing, and we expect to operationalize it shortly in the B2B space to begin with, and then extend segmental reach as we gain traction. We have named this offering as MSTC Smart Travel.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"EBITDA percentage of total income was 69.05%, which is nearly 3% higher than the corresponding period of FY26.","quote":"EBITDA percentage of total income was 69.05%, also nearly 3% higher than the corresponding period of FY26.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"Total expenses increased by 16% due to normal increases in salaries, wages, and inflationary pressures.","quote":"So, it is generally a normal increase due to increase in the salaries and wages, normal salary wages and inflationary pressure.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"The company maintained its EBITDA percentage at a similar level year-on-year despite competition and macroeconomic uncertainty.","quote":"With respect to the financials, we have been able to maintain EBITDA percentage at a similar level year-on-year. Despite competition and with the overall global macroeconomic uncertainty looming over the last two quarters and the challenges of scaling up, we have still managed to maintain it at the same level.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"},{"claim":"EBITDA for FY 25-26 stood at INR 307.49 crores compared to INR 260.04 crores for FY 24-25, an increase of 18.2%.","quote":"EBITDA stands at INR307.49 crores in '25-'26 vis-a-vis INR260.04 crores '24-'25, around an increase of 18.2% on a year-to-year basis.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"Operational highlights for FY 25-26 included 10 coal mine blocks, over 200 major mineral blocks, and coal linkage auctions obtained from Coal India Limited.","quote":"Coming to the operational highlights for FY '25-'26, 10 coal mine blocks, over 200 major mineral blocks, significantly higher scrap including quite a few plant sales, as well as coal linkage auctions, the order for which MSTC obtained from Coal India Limited through competitive bidding.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"Management decided to exit from the marketing and trading business by the first quarter of the year.","quote":"So we have decided to exit, and by the first quarter of this year it will be out of our business basket. Already out, but income will be out of our business basket.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Management noted that scrap sales and the steel sector are cyclical, causing rates and volumes to vary from time to time.","quote":"But scrap has always been a cyclical thing. The steel sector as such is very cyclical. So, the rates keep going up and down. And the volume of scrap, that also keeps changing from time to time.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf"},{"claim":"Management noted global macroeconomic uncertainty as a challenge during the year.","quote":"So despite a considerable amount of global macroeconomic uncertainty, it's my pleasure to be able to report that MSTC has been able to end the year with good numbers.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"Management targets the operationalization of the TReDS platform during FY27, subject to regulatory approvals.","quote":"This project is also at an advanced stage and subject to regulatory approvals being obtained, we should be able to operationalize this sometime during this FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"Management targets obtaining RBI approval and establishing the TReDS platform in the next few months.","quote":"So far the feedback that we have received from RBI is quite encouraging and we hope that we are able to establish this TReDS platform in the next few months.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=cd29ff2a-46af-453a-a5da-b58aa934c58a.pdf","timeframe":"next 2 years"},{"claim":"MSTC is developing a TREDs platform and has applied to RBI for requisite clearance.","quote":"MSTC is developing a TREDs platform and has applied to RBI for requisite clearance.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"ETP for EPR certification has been developed on behalf of CPCB and is awaiting go ahead for operation.","quote":"ETP for EPR certification has been developed on behalf of CPCB and is awaiting go ahead for operation.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=453eafe2-cf15-4469-bad8-0c92f3007ac3.pdf","timeframe":""},{"claim":"The company plans to complete the exit from the marketing and trading business by the first quarter of the year.","quote":"So we have decided to exit, and by the first quarter of this year it will be out of our business basket.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=c6a605d6-952c-4918-aa03-944027cb0941.pdf","timeframe":""}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":16,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":4,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}